 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_A_s4242",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[nervous, excited] 嘘，大家小声点。这走廊，怎么每条都长得一样啊。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[surprised] 诶，在那儿。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[startled, shouting] 谁！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[straining, grunting] 嗯——！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[nervous, stammering] 陛下，要、要不要帮您……",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sharp] 住口。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[panicked, fast] 陛下饶命！我们不是刺客！我们是来给您拍纪录的，记录陛下的一天！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 记录朕？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[eager, nervous] 是是是！让天下百姓都看看，陛下有多英明神武！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious, flattered] 英明神武？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[shy, sincere] 千古一帝。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[clears throat, gruff, embarrassed] 咳。拍好看点。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[gruff, proud] 跟上。朕今天，带你见见世面。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[small happy laugh] 嘿嘿，遵命。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
