      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[excited, oily] 陛下！仙药有消息了！只是……海里有条大鱼，挡着道。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "58791ad7bc6d818a68e8981ab4ccea600a45458a5e4c8c1d032528f2b8c3e6a1",
      "voice_id": "mZc8T5doZrU7OCI71i3M",
      "name": "HanBaba"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[interested] 鱼？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[hesitant] 好大一条。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "58791ad7bc6d818a68e8981ab4ccea600a45458a5e4c8c1d032528f2b8c3e6a1",
      "voice_id": "mZc8T5doZrU7OCI71i3M",
      "name": "HanBaba"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[commanding] 拿弩来。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to the audience, playful] 偷偷告诉大家，这个徐福，后来再也没回来。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 你在说什么？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flustered, too cheerful] 没、没什么！祝徐先生一路顺风！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_D_s4242",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[displeased] 丞相出个门，带这么多车？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[scornful] 哼。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[surprised, uneasy] 诶……车少了好多。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[slow, cold] 昨天朕那句话，是谁传出去的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, menacing] 你。昨天，在不在？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[terrified, stammering] 不、不在。我什么都没拍到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
