  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_E_s4242",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 4242,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[pleased, showing off] 来，给你看样东西。上回出巡。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[grand] 这棵树，挡雨有功。封它，五大夫。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 树……也能封官吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact] 朕说能，就能。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[annoyed] 这山上供的，是什么神？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[solemn] 回陛下，是尧的女儿，舜的妃子。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "MartinLi"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[furious, shouting] 砍！全给朕砍了！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "adc9f3ee76562072a32fad7d72edc6b3e523b1628c749f160e836396cd54ef0e",
      "voice_id": "pU9NaAwkoR3v0Mrg3uKz",
      "name": "Haoran"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to the audience, playful, nervous] 以后，千万别惹陛下。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
